{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" こんばちは\n \n トゥモローはお家で\n 熱唱させていただきました。\n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n \n 今日は「THE MUSIC DAY」に\n 出演させていただきました！\n ずっと見ていた番組に自分が出演したなんて\n 何だか夢のようです。\n \n 夢のような経験をたくさんさせていただいてます。\n \n 夏が始まる〜〜🎋\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34CF3N885Q2RNM1FJ0FT0H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34CG8QPXBAH2YT2AVTS31W","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n たくさんドレミソラシドしましょう〜〜\n \n \n \n \n \n そんなドレミソラシドのカップリング\n 「キツネ」のMVが少し前に公開さました🦊コン\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34CHAYEY1VQAQDHWAZ3KQB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n この曲私は今回の中で一番くらい大好きで、\n 絶対ライブで歌っても楽しいから\n はやくライブでやりたいな〜〜って\n 思います！！\n \n そんなキツネの\n そのオフショット〜〜コンコン\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34CJAYM9SR87J0FC6Q7XVT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34CKBWN5KNH6CEVEDBR16Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34CMDSXBW9K50HWJ17P490","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34CNEAT8DS22DPRXB66510","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 憧れの映え！ですね🤘\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34CPGKFN9SD74VYMRW7XTN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n やんちゃる🤘\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34CQVEEDZMXFH6BQC9W19H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34CRWSVG4K32HSH8XE6HA7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 衣装は全員違うのです！\n 私は空色ストライプの肩フリル〜\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34CSYNBXTNHRYXN4X3AVJZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 河田さんとイロチ〜です。\n \n 可愛い世界に囲まれたので\n たくさん写真載せちゃった〜〜\n \n 踊ってるパートの後ろで\n 色々自由に動いていたりするので\n たくさん見てください☺️\n ライブで歌うの楽しみにしていてください☺️\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34CTYBW9NC5Q9HH031NTD5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}